        <mxCell id="31" value="LAYERING PRINCIPLES&#xa;• Data Layer is source-of-truth (Epic-centric)&#xa;• Connectors are agent-orchestrated (not hard-wired)&#xa;• Processing is multi-channel hybrid (classical + LLM)&#xa;• 3rd-party tools grow independently via CLI wrappers&#xa;• Validation & Analytics are cross-cutting services&#xa;• Consumption builds the hospital semantic layer over time" style="rounded=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#1a202c;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
